+# M10.5 · Free return of a signed spectroscopy excitation
+
+**Proposed task.** Test the particle-stability criterion on one load dressed by a written path. The official mark on the two-load candidate at `09f062f77f7f540f2783f128ae6314c5d8b818ea` is partial. A second observer will read the signed history and the port after free flight. The proposed OPH source is `e2810645c67ca634a05ea005f84bf95dc922d66d`, a child of the public tag r2074. This task registers a historical reproduction. The original author knew the spectra, the release results and the control outcomes before proposing it. [Official criterion](../../../../../MODELS.md#simplest-test-per-criterion) · [Recorded review of M10.4](../findings/m10_4_maintainer_review.md)
+
+## Inputs and prior choices
+
+Use the original 20-cell, 240-port, 630-contact board and its native echo and degree-reference generator. Replace the eleven written contacts around two loads with the transport study's full-board arrow ordering and a single sharp load at port zero. The source prepares a geometric mode using a compiled spectroscopy word, calibrated against an isolated contact. After launch all allowed contacts act freely. Longer or reversed pulses, in-flight reset, filtering of terminal outcomes and a second load are outside the declared experiment. [Public board](https://github.com/FloatingPragma/observer-patch-holography/blob/9ade2801a7d0b5ebe16a9fc01923b93926246833/openwave/interval_echo/row_04/FEDERATION_LEVEL0.npz) · [Native source declaration](https://github.com/FloatingPragma/observer-patch-holography/blob/9ade2801a7d0b5ebe16a9fc01923b93926246833/model/candidate_laws/interval_echo/openwave/row_04_spectral/CANDIDATE.md)
+
+The earlier transport task specified ascending, reversed-local and descending arrows. The spectroscopy study compiled all 32 spatial words on the short ascending material after inspecting its spectrum. It used squared eigenspace overlap at least 0.90 for its primary positive-Laplacian convention, including zero wave number. Its staggered convention was a separate follow-up. Evaluate every original ordering before selecting the primary match at nonzero wave number. Count every admissible column and include every original start in its denominator. The original choice of eleven writes remains part of the earlier candidate's record. [Arrow alternatives](https://github.com/FloatingPragma/observer-patch-holography/blob/44f7680df55b4e68b89c301896df3e10237f046d/model/candidate_laws/interval_echo/openwave/row_30_arrows/PROTOCOL.md) · [Original operating terms](https://github.com/FloatingPragma/observer-patch-holography/blob/44f7680df55b4e68b89c301896df3e10237f046d/model/candidate_laws/interval_echo/openwave/row_30_selective/PROTOCOL.md)
